<h1>GVE Incubator Shell</h1>

Welcome to the GVE Incubator Shell. This is a shell application that can be used to quickly test out some essential functionalities in the GVE backend core.

This shell is using Blazor to minimize the amount of code needed to create a simple web UI which can directly consume the core components.
